  <name xml:lang="en">Application Portfolio Rationalisation (starter)</name>
  <documentation xml:lang="en">An application portfolio mapped to the business capabilities each application supports, scored with Gartner's TIME model: Tolerate, Invest, Migrate, Eliminate. Two applications realizing the same capability is the redundancy signal; an application nobody can map to a capability is the elimination signal. Replace the example applications with your own inventory and keep the properties filled in: they are what makes the portfolio decidable.</documentation>
